{"t":"Great Fire Wave","s":"great-fire-wave-02ea0","k":"spell","i":"assets/wiki/Great_Fire_Wave_57f7d0.gif","q":2,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Great Fire Wave</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Great Fire Wave\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"38\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Great_Fire_Wave_57f7d0.gif\" width=\"38\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Usage Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"words\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Words</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\">exevo gran flam hur</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damagetype\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Magic Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\"><img alt=\"Fire Damage\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Fire_Damage_Icon_7ba5fe.gif\" width=\"9\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">Fire Damage</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"mana\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Mana</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">120</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"subclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Group</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Attack Spells\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"20\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Attack_Cooldown_61cf3f.png\" width=\"20\"/></span></span> Attack (2 sec CD)</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"cooldown\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Individual Cooldown</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">4 seconds</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirement Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"voc\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Vocation</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"promotion\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Promotion</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"levelrequired\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">38</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"basepower\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Base Power</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">100</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">12.55.10451<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 23, 2020<br/>Vocation Adjustments 2020</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Spells <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-effect\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Effect\">Effect</span></h3>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Burned Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"11\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Burned_Icon_c21ba6.gif\" width=\"11\"/></span> Shoots an area attack directly in front of the caster, dealing <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Damage\">fire damage</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<div class=\"webdesc\">\n<blockquote class=\"webdesc-text\"><p>While most heroes who followed the rumors about Zathroth's forbidden library to fight evil, some more practical sorcerers used the opportunity to delve deeper in forbidden secrets. Most of them died. Many of them got mad. Several were viciously mutated and transformed. A few got away. Only a handful survived and gained knowledge that they could apply to new and powerful spells. The knowledge of this particular spell has come with massive casualties and suffering. A dedicated group of sorcerers managed to piece it together with bits and pieces that were gathered by the few survivors. Internal struggles of that group lead to the spell, that was intended to be kept as a secret between few, to be released to the public, probably in an act of spite of one of their members that felt unappreciated. Now the spell is taught buy the guild to its most experienced and supposedly most trustworthy members.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p>With the Wheel of Destiny/Conviction Perks, it's possible to increase its base and critical damage.\n</p>\n<div id=\"w-spell-animation\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Great Fire Wave animation\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"256\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Great_Fire_Wave_animation_e4b2a0.gif\" width=\"224\"/></span></div>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Spells\">Related Spells</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body\">\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Attack_Spells\">Attack Spells</span></h4>\n<div class=\"navigation-list-wrapper\"><ul><li>Annihilation</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Apprentice%27s%20Strike\">Apprentice's Strike</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a></li><li>Brutal Strike</li><li>Buzz</li><li>Chained Penance</li><li>Chill Out</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Curse\">Curse</a></li><li>Death Echo</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Death%20Strike\">Death Strike</a></li><li>Devastating Knockout</li><li>Divine Barrage</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Caldera\">Divine Caldera</a></li><li>Divine Grenade</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Divine%20Missile\">Divine Missile</a></li><li>Double Jab</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Electrify\">Electrify</a></li><li>Energy Beam</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Strike\">Energy Strike</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wave\">Energy Wave</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Envenom\">Envenom</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Eternal%20Winter\">Eternal Winter</a></li><li>Ethereal Barrage</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ethereal%20Spear\">E